# ============================================================
# BITHUES — Legacy .html → Clean URL Redirects
# Fixes: 21 "Page with redirect" GSC errors + prevents duplicate content
# ============================================================

# ── Host normalization: force www → bare (canonical host) ──
# Canonical tags and sitemap both point at https://bithues.com/ (bare).
# The actual www → bare 301 is enforced by a Cloudflare Page Rule on the
# bithues.com zone (target: www.bithues.com/*, action: forwarding_url 301 to
# https://bithues.com/$1). CF Pages `_redirects` only matches paths, not hosts,
# so a host-level redirect cannot be expressed here. The line below is a
# defense-in-depth no-op kept for documentation; it is silently ignored by
# Pages and the Page Rule is the source of truth.
https://www.bithues.com/* https://bithues.com/:splat 301!

